Still 1.2.0. Two fixes from your testing.

Your music is no longer quietened while pocket mode listens. Ducking does not begin when this app plays something — Apple's wording is that it begins when the session is activated and ends when it is deactivated, so a session sitting open for taps ducked your music all ride. Off while listening, kept while talking, which is where it earns its place.

And a dropped connection no longer leaves the screen locked with the slider gone.
